    <h1 class="page-title">What We Do</h1>

    <p class="lead">At Etica_Lab.Equilibrium we focus on promoting a healthy, balanced lifestyle by asking which values and ethics most accurately define us as people — through conscious eating and connection with nature. Our goal is to help you achieve a whole harmony between body, mind, and spirit. Join our community and discover the benefits of a life in balance.</p>

    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature">
        <img src="/assets/img/A7_03459.webp" alt="Personalised sessions">
        <h3 class="feature__title">Personalised sessions</h3>
        <p>We meet at your home or mine, and we cook together. From there, you can begin to weave together what works for you and what does not — especially in terms of your day-to-day shopping, and finding your creative rhythm in the kitchen so that you achieve a balance that is not just nutritional, but also comfortable and realistic given your time and your skills.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <img src="/assets/img/1o0geh.jpg" alt="Online membership">
        <h3 class="feature__title">Membership</h3>
        <p>Virtual group sessions allow people to see different perspectives and integrate new points of view into their own values. Interact and learn together from the comfort of home.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <img src="/assets/img/images-pexels-com-photos-3678182-pexels-photo-3678182-auto-compress-cs-tinysrgb-dpr-2-h-650-w-940.webp" alt="Different events">
        <h3 class="feature__title">Different events</h3>
        <p>Celebrations, weekends with friends, corporate team-building, conscious retreats…</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="headline">Food ethics classes for young people</h2>

    <div class="panel__grid panel__grid--media-text">
      <img src="/assets/img/A7_09733.webp" alt="Classes for children" style="border-radius:6px">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>Discover a different way for your children to make the most of their school holidays. When they have no classes and you still have to go to work — and there are no family members or friends available to help — we have a solution.</p>
        <p>Every school holiday we prepare activities for them. Ask us with no commitment.</p>
      </div>
